id=netstats-fix-lite
name=Network Stats Fix (Proxy + uid_stat - Lite)
version=v16-lite
versionCode=16
author=Hirbod-JORFlint
description=Lightweight fix for broken traffic indicator. Hides BPF maps to force TrafficStats fallback to /proc/uid_stat/, which is populated with real per-UID stats from /proc/net/dev. Also loads xt_qtaguid on kernel <5.0. Native binder proxy v10.0 with dynamic interfaces and per-UID stat distribution. No BPF restoration - safe for devices where BPF causes 'no internet'. Extensive logging for debugging. v16: netproxy now uses the real Android 16 INetworkStatsService AIDL transaction codes (verified from framework-connectivity-t.jar).
